---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/lecamp/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/lecamp/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Dave Yu | VOTE4YU"
  description="Dave Yu is a health-science graduate and community fitness professional running for Markham City Council, Ward 2, in 2026."
  path="/about"
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="container-1200 about">
    <p class="label-mono">ABOUT DAVE</p>
    <h1 class="about__title">A decade of health, ready for Ward 2</h1>
    <p class="about__lede">
      Dave Yu is a candidate for Markham City Council, Ward 2, in the 2026 municipal election. He has spent his career
      in community and personal health, and he is running to bring that experience to the council table.
    </p>

    <img class="about__hero" src="/images/candidate/health-interview.jpeg" alt="Dave Yu" />

    <div class="about__body">
      <h2>From Guangzhou to Markham</h2>
      <p>
        Dave was born in Guangzhou, China, and came to Canada to study in 2009 at the age of 16. He completed a
        Bachelor's degree in Health Science at Simon Fraser University, then continued his study and career in
        community and personal health development.
      </p>

      <h2>A career in community health</h2>
      <p>
        Through his work in health and fitness, Dave has partnered with government, non-profit, and private community
        health providers, including Vancouver Coastal Health, the Three Bridges Health and Rehabilitation Clinic, the
        Dr. Jerry Leung Medical Centre, and the Young and Weldrick Dental Centre.
      </p>
      <p>
        Alongside that work, Dave is a dedicated fitness professional and entrepreneur. He and his team study the needs
        of each client closely, and over the past ten years they have delivered personalised fitness and health
        services to more than 6,000 residents in Markham. Local health-community organisations he works within include
        the <a href="https://www.drjerryleung.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Dr. Jerry Leung Medical
        Club</a> and <a href="https://www.upandfit.ca/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Up&amp;Fit Fitness</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Technology for a stronger community</h2>
      <p>
        Dave believes in the practical promise of agentic and physical AI. Through his involvement with MARI, a local
        AI and robotics company in Richmond Hill, he has built a working understanding of how these tools can support
        economic and social development, and how they can help raise living standards and growth in Markham.
      </p>

      <h2>Ready to serve in 2026</h2>
      <p>
        After more than five years studying community improvement and ten years working with people from every walk of
        life, Dave Yu is ready in 2026 to work closely and diligently with the people of Markham. He wants to combine
        his expertise and experience to contribute to the continued growth of the city and the health of Ward 2.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about__cta">
      <a class="btn-rect btn-rect--ink" href="/platform">See the HEALTH platform</a>
      <a class="btn-rect btn-rect--red" href="/get-involved">Get involved</a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: 96px;
  }
  .about__title {
    font-family: var(--font-agrandir);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .about__lede {
    max-width: 60ch;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }
  .about__hero {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 440px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-cards);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }
  .about__body {
    max-width: 64ch;
    font-family: var(--font-dm-sans);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .about__body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-agrandir);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 2rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .about__body p {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .about__body a {
    color: var(--color-signal-red);
  }
  .about__cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
</style>
